["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/bower", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A reference to a Bower package. The package locator format, looks like `package#version`, is defined in the \"install\" section of [Bower API documentation](https://bower.io/docs/api/#install).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
